<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Text Formatting Example</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>HTML Text Formatting Example</h1>

    <p><b>This is Bold Text</b></p>
    <p><strong>This is Important Text</strong></p>
    <p><i>This is Italic Text</i></p>
    <p><em>This is Emphasized Text</em></p>
    <p><u>This is Underlined Text</u></p>
    <p><small>This is Small Text</small></p>
    <p><del>This is Deleted Text</del></p>
    <p><ins>This is Inserted Text</ins></p>
    <p>This is H<sub>2</sub>O using &lt;sub&gt;</p>
    <p>This is E = mc<sup>2</sup> using &lt;sup&gt;</p>
    <p><abbr title="World Health Organization">WHO</abbr></p>
    <p><q>This is a short quotation.</q></p>

</body>
</html>